table {
    table-layout: fixed;
}

/* The Chromosome lengths table's marker on a contig the labelled genome
   does not list (gain#1579): small beside the contig name, so the name
   stays what the eye reads and the sorter keys on.  Its grey comes from
   `.text-muted` in the markup, not restated here -- the one muted grey
   of the page, so a palette change is one line. */
.unlisted-marker {
    font-size: 0.85em;
    white-space: nowrap;
}
